| Layer               | Suggested choice                                                          | Reason                                                |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Android             | Kotlin + Jetpack Compose                                                  | Native Android UI and platform integration            |
| Backend             | Node.js + TypeScript, or another mature server framework                  | Centralized, testable business rules                  |
